{
  "name": "Qualify inbound leads and route them to the right campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Qualify inbound leads and route them to the right campaign\n\n### How it works\nGive every inbound signup the right next step within seconds. A POST with an email starts the workflow. Argorant enriches the address (name, title, seniority, company) and reads the company (size, country). The scoring step compares them with your ideal customer profile in Settings: allowed seniorities, minimum employees and countries. Good fits go into your sales campaign, everyone else into nurture, and the webhook answers with the score so your app can show the right page.\n\nCosts: 1 credit per enriched person found; misses are free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Edit **Settings**: seniorities, min_employees and countries of your ideal customer.\n4. Pick the campaigns in **Add to sales campaign** and **Add to nurture campaign**.\n5. POST JSON like {\"email\": \"maya.chen@linfield.example\"} to the production URL of **New signup**.\n\n### Customization\nChange the scoring rules in **Score the fit**, or add a CRM step after the routing.",
        "height": 643,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "01c74386-0ec1-416f-9a58-6c7decc5eece",
